primary_questions: (
q1- "what DC state causes the motor operating state"/a;
q2- "what motor torque and speed cause the pump operating state"/a;
q3- "what pump geometry and mechanical state cause pressure and flow"/a;
q4- "how does the closed fluid geometry modify pressure flow and velocity"/a;
q5- "what fluid state and turbine geometry cause turbine torque and speed"/a;
q6- "what turbine shaft state causes alternator electromagnetic state"/a;
q7- "what electrical load causes alternator counter torque"/a;
q8- "what alternator state produces the returned DC charging state"/a;
q9- "what returned DC state changes the battery state over time"/a;
q10- "does the complete coupled state settle decay oscillate or grow"/a;
);

